    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d648">

                <pb facs="0678" n="574" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg574"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.00/719.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the American Minister.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-05-12">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 12, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Haitian Legation in this city has not notified the Department of the death of
                    President Auguste or of the election of his successor, President Oreste. But if
                    the Government of Haiti has officially informed you that President Oreste has
                    been elected in accordance with the Constitution of Haiti you may attend all
                    functions connected with his inauguration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
